title: "Auditing Public Evaluation Specifications and Scorer Smoke-Testability: audit corpus, coding instrument, and execution record"
abstract: >-
  An evidence dataset and analysis pipeline auditing the public evaluation
  reproducibility of 26 foundation-model benchmark releases for data-science tasks,
  laddered as Described, Accessible, Reconstructable, and Smoke-testable, with
  CPU-only evaluator smoke tests.
